WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Settings & channels”, then open the “Channels” tab.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Choose Telegram
Open Settings & channels, then choose Telegram from the channels.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Add the bot token
Prepare the bot token from your Telegram account and enter it in the channel setup field. Keep the token secret.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Save and test
Save the channel setup, send a message to the bot from another account and check that it appears in Conversations.
